+    /// memory), ModRM.reg = dst. xmm-only ISA — any ymm operand is
+    /// `operand size mismatch` (GAS 2.47, byte-probed: the family has
+    /// no ymm forms, so ymm is a SIZE error, not a width-mixing one).
